# Everything is stored and checked out as LF.
#
# This is a cross-platform project and the toolchain does not agree on line
# endings: cargo fmt and biome both want LF, and a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true hands them CRLF instead. Setting eol=lf here overrides
# core.autocrlf, so the working copy on every platform matches what is stored.
#
# Without this, biome reported 11 000 formatting errors on a tree that was
# already correctly formatted - every one of them a CR at the end of a line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touched, never diffed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.exe binary
